---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Disclosure | Nether"
  description="How Nether handles store links, product ratings, images, measurements, and AI-assisted work."
>
  <main class="archive-page plain-page disclosure-page">
    <header class="archive-header">
      <h1>Disclosure</h1>
      <p>
        Nether includes links to products and information from other sites.
        This page explains how those links, ratings, images, and research are
        handled.
      </p>
    </header>
    <section class="plain-page-section">
      <h2>Store links and commissions</h2>
      <p>
        Product pages link to searches on Shopee, Lazada, and Amazon. These
        destinations can change when a product record is updated. Some links
        may be affiliate links, or may become affiliate links later. If I earn
        a commission from a qualifying purchase, it does not add to your cost.
      </p>
      <p>
        A store controls its own prices, stock, shipping, returns, and purchase
        terms. Check the listing and the store's terms before buying. Following
        a link takes you away from Nether and to that store.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="plain-page-section">
      <h2>Ratings and editorial independence</h2>
      <p>
        Ratings and opinions are mine. I assess products against the criteria
        described in <a href="/gear/how-i-rate/">How I rate gear</a>, then
        consider price and alternatives. A commission does not determine a
        product's score, verdict, or place in an article.
      </p>
      <p>
        A product may be bought, borrowed, or provided; that can differ from
        one product to another. The gear records distinguish hands-on scores
        from research based on specifications and reviewer consensus, but do
        not record the source of every sample. I will not imply a particular
        purchase or supply arrangement unless the relevant review says so.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="plain-page-section">
      <h2>Images and measurements</h2>
      <p>
        Product images remain the property of their respective owners. Where an
        image source or credit is available, I include it with the image.
        Images are for product reference and do not imply that Nether owns or
        produced them.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I include a frequency response graph, it comes from a public
        community measurement database such as Squig.link or an equivalent
        source. The note for these graphs is: “Public measurement from community
        database (Squig.link or equivalent). Actual response varies with tips
        and seal.” These are not my measurements unless a page explicitly says
        otherwise.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="plain-page-section">
      <h2>AI-assisted work</h2>
      <p>
        I may use AI tools while preparing articles. When AI materially shapes
        an article, I will note that near the article. I review details before
        publication and remain responsible for the published work.
      </p>
    </section>
    <nav aria-label="Related pages" class="plain-page-links">
      <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>
      <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <p class="legal-updated">
      Last updated <time datetime="2026-11-02">November 2, 2026</time>.
    </p>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
